<title>ANTIGUA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES AND INDIA DRAW FOURTH TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES AND INDIA DRAW FOURTH TEST.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHN'S, Antigua 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies and India drew the fourth cricket test on the fifth and final day on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 333-9 declared (B.Lara 103, R.Holder 56), India 212-2 (A.Jadeja 96, V.Laxman 56).</p>
</text>
